M2 -- the SAME physical time at different sub-step counts: does subdividing aggravate?
============================================================================================
  maximumFractionalChange is the knob. A tenth of the value means roughly ten
  times the sub-steps for the same dt. If the drift is per-STEP, it must rise
  with the sub-step count; if it does not accumulate, it must not.

